      DialogDataSet:[
        {
          Label:"ds2_honoured",
          Name:"Dragon Slayer",
          Priority:80,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"Two dragons. You're the greatest dragon slayer this city has known, @initiator. Wear dragon armour with pride: no one will say otherwise while I live."
            }
          ],
          Conditions:[
            {
              Type:"PLAYER_TAG",
              Name:"q_ds2_done"
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
            {
              Label:"ds2_honoured_0",
              Name:"Goodbye",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"CLOSE_DIALOG"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          Label:"ds2_head",
          Name:"Her head?",
          Priority:75,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"You've the smell of smoke about you. Crandor? Well? Did you bring me Elvarg's head?"
            }
          ],
          Conditions:[
            {
              Type:"PLAYER_TAG",
              Name:"q_ds2_elvarg"
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
            {
              Label:"ds2_head_0",
              Name:"Here it is",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"COMMAND",
                  Cmd:"/lsp quest step @initiator dragon_slayer_2 head @npc-uuid"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              Label:"ds2_head_1",
              Name:"Not yet",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"CLOSE_DIALOG"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          Label:"ds2_done",
          Name:"Elvarg is dead",
          Priority:-1,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"Elvarg... dead at last. She burnt my ship and half my crew. You've earned the right to wear dragon armour, @initiator: scale and steel both."
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
            {
              Label:"ds2_done_0",
              Name:"Thank you, Oziach",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"CLOSE_DIALOG"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          Label:"ds2_no_head",
          Name:"No head",
          Priority:-1,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"Where's her head? Bring me proof, or don't come back."
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
            {
              Label:"ds2_no_head_0",
              Name:"I'll get it",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"CLOSE_DIALOG"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          Label:"ds2_go",
          Name:"Crandor",
          Priority:70,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"Follow Traiborn's map to Crandor. Old Ned keeps a memorial at the foot of Elvarg's hill: he'll see you up to her. Hold your shield up when she breathes."
            }
          ],
          Conditions:[
            {
              Type:"PLAYER_TAG",
              Name:"q_ds2_map"
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
            {
              Label:"ds2_go_0",
              Name:"Goodbye",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"CLOSE_DIALOG"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          Label:"ds2_wizard",
          Name:"Finding Crandor",
          Priority:65,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"No map shows Crandor any more, and no captain will sail there. But Wizard Traiborn can scry it, if you bring him what it takes to find a dragon: the breath of another one. Bottle the Ender Dragon's."
            }
          ],
          Conditions:[
            {
              Type:"PLAYER_TAG",
              Name:"q_ds2_started"
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
            {
              Label:"ds2_wizard_0",
              Name:"Goodbye",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"CLOSE_DIALOG"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          Label:"ds2_offer",
          Name:"Another dragon",
          Priority:62,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"The Ender Dragon, dead. I never thought I'd see it.

But she isn't the dragon I lost my ship to, @initiator. That was Elvarg, a fire dragon of the old world, on the isle of Crandor. She's burnt every ship that went near it since. Will you hunt her?"
            }
          ],
          Conditions:[
            {
              Type:"PLAYER_TAG",
              Name:"q_ds_done"
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
            {
              Label:"ds2_offer_0",
              Name:"I'll hunt her",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"COMMAND",
                  Cmd:"/tag @initiator add q_ds2_started"
                },
                {
                  Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                  Cmd:"ds2_wizard"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              Label:"ds2_offer_1",
              Name:"Not now",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"CLOSE_DIALOG"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          Label:"ds_head",
          Name:"Her head?",
          Priority:50,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"You've the look of someone who's been to the End. Well? Did you bring me her head?"
            }
          ],
          Conditions:[
            {
              Type:"PLAYER_TAG",
              Name:"q_ds_dragon"
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
            {
              Label:"ds_head_0",
              Name:"Here it is",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"COMMAND",
                  Cmd:"/lsp quest step @initiator dragon_slayer head @npc-uuid"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              Label:"ds_head_1",
              Name:"Not yet",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"CLOSE_DIALOG"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          Label:"ds_done",
          Name:"Dragon Slayer",
          Priority:-1,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"You did it. You actually did it. The Ender Dragon is dead, @initiator.

Come and see me again: there is another dragon I have a score to settle with."
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
            {
              Label:"ds_done_0",
              Name:"Thank you, Oziach",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"CLOSE_DIALOG"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          Label:"ds_map",
          Name:"The End",
          Priority:40,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"Follow that map to the stronghold. Under it is the portal: fill its frame with eyes of ender. On her island, break her crystals first: they heal her. Hold your shield up when she breathes, and bring me her head.

If someone slew her before you, four end crystals on the edge of her portal will wake her again."
            }
          ],
          Conditions:[
            {
              Type:"PLAYER_TAG",
              Name:"q_ds_map"
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
            {
              Label:"ds_map_0",
              Name:"Goodbye",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"CLOSE_DIALOG"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          Label:"ds_pieces",
          Name:"The map",
          Priority:30,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"Got the three pieces of the map yet? Lucan the Jeweller has one, Wizard Traiborn another, and the Guild gives the third to those who pass its trial."
            }
          ],
          Conditions:[
            {
              Type:"PLAYER_TAG",
              Name:"q_ds_oziach"
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
            {
              Label:"ds_pieces_0",
              Name:"Here they are",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"COMMAND",
                  Cmd:"/lsp quest step @initiator dragon_slayer map @npc-uuid"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              Label:"ds_pieces_1",
              Name:"Where are they again?",
              Actions:[
