                  Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                  Cmd:"ds_where"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              Label:"ds_pieces_2",
              Name:"Goodbye",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"CLOSE_DIALOG"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          Label:"ds_intro",
          Name:"The Ender Dragon",
          Priority:20,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"So the Guild sent you. You want to slay the Ender Dragon? Many have tried. She lives on an island at the end of the world, through a portal under one of the old strongholds, and the only map to them was torn in three.

Find the three pieces and bring them here. And get an anti-dragon shield from the mayor: her breath will melt you in your armour without one."
            }
          ],
          Conditions:[
            {
              Type:"PLAYER_TAG",
              Name:"q_ds_started"
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
            {
              Label:"ds_intro_0",
              Name:"I'll do it",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"COMMAND",
                  Cmd:"/tag @initiator add q_ds_oziach"
                },
                {
                  Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                  Cmd:"ds_where"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              Label:"ds_intro_1",
              Name:"Maybe later",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"CLOSE_DIALOG"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          Label:"ds_where",
          Name:"The pieces",
          Priority:-1,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"One piece is with Lucan the Jeweller: he bought it off a treasure hunter and he'll want paying. One is with Wizard Traiborn in his tower by the wall. The third is the Champions' Guild's: pass its trial (your quest book says how) and it's yours."
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
            {
              Label:"ds_where_0",
              Name:"I'm on it",
              Actions:[
                {
                  Type:"CLOSE_DIALOG"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
